    "elevation-sticky-edge": {
      "$type": "dimension",
      "$value": "inset 0 -1px 0 0 var(--edge)",
      "$extensions": {
        "fuelguard.section": [
          "Not depth \u2014 a hairline. A sticky <thead> cannot keep a border-bottom while its table scrolls under it, so the rule is drawn as an inset shadow instead. Named here (D-DS7a) because it had been living in DataTable as `shadow-[inset_0_-1px_0_0_var(--edge)]`, which is a design decision spelled as a magic string: unreusable, and invisible to a future theme that re-points --edge."
        ],
        "fuelguard.expose": "shadow"
      }
    },
